## Scryfall

Card data comes from the **Scryfall** bulk data API (`api.scryfall.com`). Card
images in `viz/` and in `manuals/*.html` are **hot-linked** to
`cards.scryfall.io` and are not copied into this repository.

Scryfall's own contributions to that data (rulings aggregation, printing
metadata, the API itself) are made available by Scryfall; the card names, text
and images within it remain the property of Wizards of the Coast. Scryfall asks
that projects using its data credit it and not imply endorsement. This project
does both: it is not affiliated with or endorsed by Scryfall.

## Commander Spellbook

Combo data (`data/combo_details.json`, `data/combo_graph.json`) is derived from
the **Commander Spellbook** API. Not affiliated with or endorsed by them.

## Third-party code

The frontend loads **d3** v7 from a CDN (BSD-3-Clause). Python dependencies are
declared in `pyproject.toml` and carry their own licences; none is vendored
here.

## Fonts

`manuals/` and `viz/deck.html` reference Google Fonts by URL. No font files are
